5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I should check the structural survey of the suspended bay and the evening hire bookings in the gallery. I want to make sure the space can handle everything.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the five years of visitor comment slips and the weekend head counts across ten seasons. I believe the historical data on visitor engagement is essential.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know who is actually working! I'll check the composition of the volunteer roster and the conservation lab staffing and backlog.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
8,1,1,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to see where things actually went wrong! I'll check the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the maintenance log for powered displays.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
10,1,1,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
11,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I shall investigate the loan transport costs over three seasons and the mount-making charges and joiner's rate. I suspect there are some rather imaginative expenses hiding in our logistics.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
